**Goal:** Ship Moxito MVP (Farcaster login + fitness metrics) by January 31, 2025
**Time:** 5 hours/day, Mon-Sat (with holiday flexibility) = ~240 hours total
**MVP Scope:** Reown/Farcaster authentication + HealthKit/HealthConnect metrics display

