### ✅ What You Already Have
- React Native Expo bare workflow project (https://github.com/leovido/moxito-react-native)
- iOS/Swift/SwiftUI expert (9 years)
- Expo Router + TypeScript setup
- Redux configured (we'll migrate to Zustand)
