## Tech Stack (Finalized)

**Core:**
- React Native (Expo bare workflow)
- TypeScript
- Expo Router (file-based routing)

**State Management:**
- Zustand (local state)
- TanStack Query (server/API state)

**Build System:**
- Turborepo (monorepo)
- EAS Build (CI/CD)
- GitHub Actions

**Key Dependencies:**
- Reown SDK (Farcaster auth)
- expo-secure-store (token storage)
- react-native-health (HealthKit - iOS)
- react-native-health-connect (HealthConnect - Android)

**Quality:**
- Biome (linting/formatting) - you already have this
- Jest (testing)
- Maestro (E2E testing)
- Sentry (crash reporting)

